   "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"nl\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>TEST-Studio Noord — Logo</title></head><body><main class=\"page\"><header class=\"masthead\"><span class=\"label\"><b>TEST-Studio Noord</b> — Designsysteem</span><span class=\"label\">04 — Logo</span><span class=\"label\">v1.0 · nov 2026</span></header><section class=\"intro\"><p class=\"num\">04</p><div class=\"what\"><h1 class=\"title\">Logo</h1><p class=\"lede\">Een noordpijl in een cirkel naast het woordmerk. Het logo staat altijd op een rustige ondergrond en krijgt ruimte om zich heen.</p></div></section><section class=\"sect\"><div class=\"sect-head\"><span class=\"label\">Varianten</span><span class=\"label\">Primair · wit · op accent</span></div><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"c4\"><div class=\"lv bg-bg\"><img class=\"only-light \" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Logo TEST-Studio Noord\"><img class=\"only-dark \" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Logo TEST-Studio Noord\"></div><p class=\"label cap\"><b>Op achtergrond</b></p></div><div class=\"c4\"><div class=\"lv bg-text\"><img class=\"only-light\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Logo wit\"><img class=\"only-dark\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Logo primair\"></div><p class=\"label cap\"><b>Op tekstkleur</b></p></div><div class=\"c4\"><div class=\"lv bg-accent\"><img class=\"only-light\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Logo wit\"><img class=\"only-dark\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Logo primair\"></div><p class=\"label cap\"><b>Op accent</b></p></div></div></section><section class=\"sect\"><div class=\"sect-head\"><span class=\"label\">Vrije ruimte en minimummaat</span><span class=\"label\">X = hoogte van de cirkel</span></div><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"c7\"><div class=\"clear\"><div class=\"zone\"><span class=\"x t\">X</span><span class=\"x b\">X</span><span class=\"x l\">X</span><span class=\"x r\">X</span><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Logo met vrije ruimte\"></div></div><p class=\"label cap\">Rondom minstens X vrij · niets binnen de stippellijn</p></div><div class=\"c5\"><div class=\"min\"><figure><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Logo op minimummaat\" style=\"width:120px\"><figcaption class=\"label\"><b>120 px</b> · woordmerk</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCA4MCA4MCI+PGNpcmNsZSBjeD0iNDAiIGN5PSI0MCIgcj0iMzEiIGZpbGw9Im5vbmUiIHN0cm9rZT0iIzFjMWIxOSIgc3Ryb2tlLXdpZHRoPSI0LjUiLz48cGF0aCBkPSJNNDAgMTMgTDU1IDU0IEw0MCA0NSBMMjUgNTQgWiIgZmlsbD0iIzBmNzY2ZSIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" alt=\"Beeldmerk op minimummaat\" style=\"width:24px\"><figcaption class=\"label\"><b>24 px</b> · beeldmerk</figcaption></figure></div><p class=\"label cap\">Kleiner dan 120 px: alleen het beeldmerk</p></div></div></section><section class=\"sect\"><div class=\"sect-head\"><span class=\"label\">Zo niet</span><span class=\"label\">Altijd het originele bestand</span></div><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"c3\"><div class=\"lv small-lv\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scaleX(1.35)\"></div><p class=\"label cap\"><span class=\"niet\">Niet</span> uitrekken</p></div><div class=\"c3\"><div class=\"lv small-lv\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:rotate(-12deg)\"></div><p class=\"label cap\"><span class=\"niet\">Niet</span> draaien</p></div><div class=\"c3\"><div class=\"lv small-lv\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\" style=\"filter:sepia(1) saturate(5) hue-rotate(-25deg)\"></div><p class=\"label cap\"><span class=\"niet\">Niet</span> andere kleuren</p></div><div class=\"c3\"><div class=\"lv small-lv\"><img class=\"bgphoto\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1561070791-2526d30994b5?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\" style=\"\"></div><p class=\"label cap\"><span class=\"niet\">Niet</span> op een drukke foto